      "author": {
        "id": 1882526
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-11T12:26:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that this will generate a salt (`SMCCC_TRNG` calls) to be stored in the instance.img, which is then never read; would you mind splitting up `get_or_generate_instance_salt` so that this path can simply read/write an entry with no (or zeroed) salt?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 158,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 159,
        "endChar": 42
      },
      "revId": "e7bd85d00674fce13f41472b15a9d4ad2e016889",
